# Mode: news

Use when the user asks to write, edit, plan, or localize a **blog / news** article for this site (`/news/`, `lib/news-details.ts`, `lib/i18n/news-copy.ts`).

## Before drafting (required reads)

1. Persona: `.cursor/agents/content.md` (+ `.cursor/agents/seo.md`); prompt `.cursor/prompts/create-blog.md` / `pipeline.md`
2. Content rules: `content-brand`, `content-writing`, `content-forbidden`, `content-seo`, **`seo-geo-html`**
3. Knowledge: `.cursor/knowledge/` (topic files that match the brief)
4. Tone: `.cursor/examples/blog/`
5. `documentations/agent-ops.md` (checklist)
6. `documentations/seo-keywords.md` — P1/P2 keyword (P3 AI only if user asks upsell)
7. `documentations/growth-reach-users.md` — ICP web-first, CTA → Zalo / quote / relevant URL
8. `documentations/brand-voice.md`
9. Existing article shape: `lib/news-details.ts` (+ locale copy)

Also apply skills when relevant:

- **seo** — title, slug, excerpt, internal links
- **lang** — target locale(s); JA → also `documentations/geo-japan.md`

## Workflow

1. Short plan (keyword, slug, locale, outline) → wait for **`ok`**
2. Implement only news-related files unless user asks otherwise
3. Update `documentations/changelog.md` if the change is non-trivial
4. New article with custom images → add `documentations/news-{slug}-canva-prompts.md` (see existing examples)
5. Do not invent case metrics or customer names

## Output shape (draft)

- Title + slug suggestion  
- Excerpt (1–2 sentences)  
- Body sections (short paragraphs)  
- Primary keyword + 1–2 internal links (e.g. `/services/web/`, `/#popular-services`)  
- Optional JA summary if locale is vi/en and user cares about Japan  
